section: rts
synopsis: Fix AArch64 veneer target for relocations with an addend
description:
  The RTS linker would construct invalid relocation veneers on AArch64 if the
  addend was non-zero, which typically caused SIGILL crashes.
  This could be triggered by evaluating Template Haskell in a package with a
  large number of dependencies using a static build of GHC.
mrs: !16686
issues: #27807
